            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;Overriding default gaps parameters for defined SurfaceLabel(see Surfaces tab). Format:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;SurfaceLabel:&amp;lt;left,right,top,bottom,between&amp;gt;=number,...&amp;lt;Enter&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;left,right,top,bottom,between&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt; or you can use shortname&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt; l,r,t,b,e &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;You can only write down the parameters you want to change. Examples:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;on your defined surface(see surfaces tab) with name: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;myFirstMonitor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt; will override right gap to 10, left gap to 20 and between gap to 10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;MyFirstMonitor:r=10,l=20,between=10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
            </property>
            <property name="placeholderText">
             <string>SurfaceLabel:&lt;left,right,top,bottom,between&gt;=number,...&lt;Enter&gt;</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
