          <string>Window class configuration</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item row="6" column="0">
        <widget class="QPlainTextEdit" name="kcfg_dockWindowClassConfig">
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Overriding default parameters for the specified WindowClass. Format:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;WindowClass&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;SpecialFlag,SpecialFlag...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;shortname=value,shortname=value...&amp;lt;Enter&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;format with specified titlе, you can specify only part of the title by writing it in square brackets:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;WindowClass&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;SpecialFlag,SpecialFlag...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;shortname=value,shortname=value...&amp;lt;Enter&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;pin - &lt;/span&gt;docked window with this flag will displace another if their positions are equal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;left,right,top,bottom&lt;/span&gt; - you can use one them to explicitly set the initial position.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; - automatically makes a window docked. Krohnkite version &amp;gt;=0.9.9.1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can only write down the parameters you want to change. You can see the short name of the parameter if you hover over any default parameter above.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Examples:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. if Elisa switches to dock it will have higher priority, top dock position and 10% of screen height &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;org.kde.elisa&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;:pin,top:hh=10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2. Conky automatic docking:     &lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Hack'; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Conky&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Hack'; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Hack'; font-weight:700;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Hack';&quot;&gt;3.With title specified: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;com.obsproject.Studio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Scripts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;auto,left&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;vw=50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item row="4" column="0">
        <widget class="QPlainTextEdit" name="kcfg_dockSurfacesConfig">
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;Overriding default parameters for every surface. Format: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;OuputName:ActivityId:VirtualDesktopName:shortname=value,shortname=value... &amp;lt;Enter&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;You can only write down parameters you want to change. You can see the short name of the parameter if you hover over any default parameter above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;Next example override three params on all surfaces with OutputName=HDMI-A-1 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;HDMI-A-1:::hh=80,vw=80,ha=left&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;this one, will override two params only for defined display, virtual desktop and activity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;HDMI-A-1:99e10d31-e8f3-44aa-bbed-2a543f13fa54:Desktop 1:vg=5,va=2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
